# GA-008: Dorian reviews the gate, not every change (DR-113, DESIGN.md Constraints).
# Everything not listed here merges on a clean cross-vendor review and green `tests`.
# Owned: what CI runs to gate main, what sets the agent's token and data permissions, what
# caps spend, and the goal folders. The agent's own tooling (review dispatcher, goal runner)
# is not, since 2026-10-05 at Dorian's instruction: its fixes merge on a clean review.
# A path listed here needs his approving review: the ruleset requires code-owner review.
# .github/test_codeowners.py fails if a gate path drops out of this file or a catch-all returns.

