# GO-011.9 (Dorian, 2026-11-15: "I approve this and it needs to be added to our plugins"): the first two successors of a
# goal that failed its holdout or whole-goal review carry no owner. goal_successor.py, run in the required `tests`
# check, holds them instead: added once, nothing else changed, and the approved brief kept word for word. A third
# successor (--s3) matches neither line and needs his review like any goal.
/goals/*--s1/
/goals/*--s2/
/plugins/gstack-execution/scripts/goal_successor.py @dorianatmoxywolf
